# A person who does not exist.
#
# Here the checker cannot ask "did you see this" — there is nothing to see.
# It asks a different question: if she acts against her own nature, is the
# reason on the page?

character Ada

    role  protagonist

    trait claustrophobic
        when      in small enclosed spaces

    trait loyal
        when      a friend is in trouble

    scene the-lift
        does      steps into the lift and rides it to the ninth floor
        against   claustrophobic
        because   she has decided the fear is a luxury she cannot afford

    scene the-letter
        does      reads the letter twice, then drives four hours
        shows     loyal

end
